# Profile setup (feature 010, research R11, contracts/parity.md §3): POST /server/setup needs a database without any
# directus_users row, so this pair has its own Postgres (postgres-setup) and never touches the shared parity database.
# ADMIN_EMAIL and ADMIN_PASSWORD are empty, so the bootstrap of the Directus image creates the Administrator role and
# policy but no user (createAdmin returns early). Redis db 9 keeps every cache, bus, lock, permissions and sync key of
# this pair away from the main pair. Postgres only (env/postgres.env first). Test values only.
DB_HOST=postgres-setup
ADMIN_EMAIL=
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
REDIS=redis://redis:6379/9
PUBLIC_URL=http://localhost:10455
CACHE_NAMESPACE=parity-setup
